OL,3,GNEWSAI couldn't cook when I left home `
OL,4,Abut these easy #2.50 recipes became my
OL,5,Ago-to
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen Mia Jones left her home in
OL,8,FAnglesey to go to university in London,
OL,9,Fshe couldn't cook "whatsoever" - but
OL,10,Fquickly realised this had to change.
OL,12,F"I couldn't live off pasta for the rest
OL,13,Fof my life," she says - and all the
OL,14,Fready meals and pot noodles were
OL,15,Fstarting to add up.
OL,17,F"I'd be spending #45 a week on food,"
OL,18,Fsays the 22-year-old. "That wasn't
OL,19,Fviable."
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
