OL,3,GNEWSAI couldn't cook when I left home `
OL,4,Abut these easy #2.50 recipes became my
OL,5,Ago-to
OL,6,
OL,7,FSo she started buying fresh
OL,8,Fingredients. "Then I realised, 'Oh, I
OL,9,Fneed to learn how to cook now.'" She
OL,10,Fstarted following social media videos
OL,11,Ffor tips and recipes, swapping out
OL,12,Ffoods she didn't like.
